{"id":132128062320193,"name":"[🎣] Gone Hunting","desc":"🦌 Welcome to Gone Hunting 🎣\n\nUpdate 4 ✨\n● NEW AREA! The Rainveil Forest! 🐍\n● New Grappler, Gear, Animals, and More!\n\nHunt and fish your way through a relaxing RPG adventure. Explore a living world with dynamic weather, rare catches, and skill-based challenges.\n\n✨ Features\n• Hunting rifle minigame – accuracy matters, aim for the middle!\n• Unique fishing system – tap fast to reel in your catch!\n• Passive trapping – earn even while offline!\n• 8 dynamic weather types that change spawns & maps!\n• Stack up weather traits to get the most valuable animals!\n\n🎮 How To Play\n• Equip your rifle, rod, or traps from your gear inventory\n• Explore the map to find animals and fishing spots\n• Complete minigames to secure your catch\n• Sell your finds, upgrade gear, and get the most rare animals!","path":"/game/132128062320193-gone-hunting","slug":"132128062320193-gone-hunting","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/582076d8c56c35312293aab2cf81668f367ac5572577c12851a141118ee8c321.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-bf646c2fc92f25cab952031cadfbc944/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":33,"visitor":12464514,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-05-23T17:58:00.707Z","creator":{"name":"Wallaby Wiggins","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":2,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Gone-Hunting-Purple-HUB-OP-201381","_id":"69de79d336fe70e0913ff27f","title":"Purple HUB OP","game":{"_id":"68d58aa57f9f7255ef3fd36f","gameId":132128062320193,"name":"[🎣] Gone Hunting","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":132128062320193},"features":"New script for Gone Hunting!\nSoon ill add scanner, so wait for it\n\nMuch functions such as ESP, Played modifier and instant ctach!","tags":["Hunting","HUB","Gone hunting","OP","VERY OP"],"script":"loadstrin